{"4312690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MMNANA", "steam_appid": 4312690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4335310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/ee78e920a1e0e76ebe0208bf3877b8e3.gif?t=1774821277\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/ee78e920a1e0e76ebe0208bf3877b8e3.poster.avif?t=1774821277\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover the meaning of MMNANA by unlocking all 8 endings in the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GENERAL INFORMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MMNANA is a small 3D adventure and platforming game in which you must adapt to unusual controls after a boat accident. You wake up on the shore of a mysterious island, stalked by a tribe that does not speak your language and whom you decide to follow in search of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will notice the game’s striking art style. What initially appears cheerful and lighthearted gradually becomes far more sinister and unsettling than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/3c60b39d691dc39f9cd74cd8c722e39e.poster.avif?t=1774821277\" width=576 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/3c60b39d691dc39f9cd74cd8c722e39e.webm?t=1774821277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/3c60b39d691dc39f9cd74cd8c722e39e.mp4?t=1774821277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an accident, you have lost the ability to walk normally. Crawl by alternating between Q and E, and move your head to look around using WASD. You can also jump by propelling yourself while holding the SPACEBAR, which will help you perform precise jumps across cliffs, rivers, and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/864eec8965cbe1f97359beb24cbd2e99.poster.avif?t=1774821277\" width=576 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/864eec8965cbe1f97359beb24cbd2e99.webm?t=1774821277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/864eec8965cbe1f97359beb24cbd2e99.mp4?t=1774821277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island you reach after surviving a shipwreck is inhabited by a peculiar tribe: strange, corpulent creatures with a childlike appearance. This tribe experiments with a mysterious rainbow compound in an attempt to achieve immortality, and you become their new test subject…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your exploration, you discover they are not the only inhabitants of the archipelago. There is another tribe, whose real name you do not know, so you decide to call them the Bird Tribe. They are not exactly good, but they are less cruel than the first. They also seek revenge, as the other tribe kidnaps their people to use them in their experiments.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/ee78e920a1e0e76ebe0208bf3877b8e3.gif?t=1774821277\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/ee78e920a1e0e76ebe0208bf3877b8e3.poster.avif?t=1774821277\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover the meaning of MMNANA by unlocking all 8 endings in the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GENERAL INFORMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MMNANA is a small 3D adventure and platforming game in which you must adapt to unusual controls after a boat accident. You wake up on the shore of a mysterious island, stalked by a tribe that does not speak your language and whom you decide to follow in search of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will notice the game’s striking art style. What initially appears cheerful and lighthearted gradually becomes far more sinister and unsettling than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/3c60b39d691dc39f9cd74cd8c722e39e.poster.avif?t=1774821277\" width=576 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/3c60b39d691dc39f9cd74cd8c722e39e.webm?t=1774821277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/3c60b39d691dc39f9cd74cd8c722e39e.mp4?t=1774821277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an accident, you have lost the ability to walk normally. Crawl by alternating between Q and E, and move your head to look around using WASD. You can also jump by propelling yourself while holding the SPACEBAR, which will help you perform precise jumps across cliffs, rivers, and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/864eec8965cbe1f97359beb24cbd2e99.poster.avif?t=1774821277\" width=576 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/864eec8965cbe1f97359beb24cbd2e99.webm?t=1774821277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312690/extras/864eec8965cbe1f97359beb24cbd2e99.mp4?t=1774821277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island you reach after surviving a shipwreck is inhabited by a peculiar tribe: strange, corpulent creatures with a childlike appearance. This tribe experiments with a mysterious rainbow compound in an attempt to achieve immortality, and you become their new test subject…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your exploration, you discover they are not the only inhabitants of the archipelago. There is another tribe, whose real name you do not know, so you decide to call them the Bird Tribe. They are not exactly good, but they are less cruel than the first. They also seek revenge, as the other tribe kidnaps their people to use them in their experiments.</p>", "short_description": "MMNANA is a 3D adventure with 2D pixel art where, after an accident, you must learn to move from scratch and discover whether you can escape an island by crawling using only your hands.", "s